      "content": "<h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Introduction:&nbsp;</b></span></h2><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4d21972f-7fff-4333-8443-82621549d0fd\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur, one of the fast-emerging residential locality in Bangalore, has emerged as a sought-after destination for families who seek rental apartments. Well-laid-out infrastructure, top-class connectivity, and plenty of amenities make this destination suitable for parents, and kids. Searching for an ideal family friendly home in Sarjapur can be tough, but with expert advice, it can be a fun-filled process. This guide eases the house hunting process, so that families get a suitable rental house within their budget and expectations.</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><b>Why Families Prefer Sarjapur</b></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Sarjapur is popular as a good family residential area due to several factors:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/qpqGPLoYQjs\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"note-video-clip\"></iframe><br></p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Safe &amp; Secure Environment</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">One among the most vital considerations of family members in locating a rental accommodation is safety. Sarjapur boasts many guarded communities with perpetual security personnel on duty, vigilance cameras, and brightly illuminated roads. Quite a few living areas in Sarjapur come equipped with precautions for ensuring families' safety within a quiet surrounding environment.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Proximity to Schools &amp; Educational Institutions</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">For parents, distance to quality schools is a major factor. Sarjapur boasts several top-quality schools like Oakridge International School, The International School Bangalore (TISB), Inventure Academy, and Harvest International School. Living close to highly ranked schools allows easy transport means for children and quality education.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Healthcare &amp; Emergency Services</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Availability of good healthcare centers is a must for families. Sarjapur has multi-specialty hospitals and clinics like Columbia Asia Hospital, Motherhood Hospital, and Narayana Health, which offer special care to children, the elderly, and working professionals.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Balanced Urban &amp; Suburban Living</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Unlike Bangalore's overcrowded central places, Sarjapur offers both the convenience of city life as well as tranquility of suburban life. Despite having malls, shopping complexes, restaurants, and entertainment centers, it also comprises a lot of greenery, parks, and quiet neighborhoods—a thing essential to a quality of life.</p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><b>Types of Family-Friendly Houses Available</b></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">There are various kinds of rental houses which the family can choose, according to their lifestyle and preference.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Independent Houses</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Ideal for those who require space and privacy, independent houses are highly common in Sarjapur. Independent houses offer the professionals multiple rooms, and they can customize as per their requirement as well. They are ideal for large families and people who prefer separate living areas.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Villa Communities</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Gated villa communities offer luxury and security with the benefits of single-family homes. These include amenities like clubhouses, parks, playgrounds, and common areas—perfect for families looking for a safe area for kids to play.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Gated Apartments</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">For all such families who enjoy having their community, gated residential apartment complexes provide ample facilities like swimming pools, children's playgrounds, gyms, and security personnel. They even allow neighborly interaction, offering a busy and concerned environment.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Duplex Homes</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Duplex houses cater to families that require multi-story living spaces, ideal for homeowners that require privacy amidst common areas and bedrooms.Duplex houses offer equal communal and private living without compromising space.</p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Furnished, Semi-Furnished, or Unfurnished Homes</h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Families have to make a choice if they would prefer a <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/fully-furnished\" target=\"_blank\">furnished</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/semi-furnished\" target=\"_blank\">semi-furnished</a>, or <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/unfurnished\" target=\"_blank\">unfurnished home</a>. Furnished homes save the inconvenience of purchasing furniture, but semi-furnished and unfurnished homes enable families to personalize their environment based on their requirements.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><br></p><div><br></div><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-cc227712-7fff-3a85-889c-5b041357f4d3\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Locality</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1427843f-7fff-a46c-2014-3185a08237fd\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>2BHK Rent (₹)</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-87698af3-7fff-eada-d3bd-c1d2e9c4ee68\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>3BHK Rent (₹)</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-51e157fd-7fff-7ff6-0d7d-a92908ac35d6\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Best For</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9655d177-7fff-b15f-ecb5-37f165580c5f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Key Features</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-863bb198-7fff-d590-3c5b-a9af70a8fd46\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Sarjapur Road</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-89a24958-7fff-8d39-1370-179ad70dcb3e\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">30,000 – 45,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e1e8e43b-7fff-8a24-2b66-e33e3844db95\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">45,000 – 65,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-044a6e73-7fff-2e8a-9811-1fe3b5dc1609\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Connectivity</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-82a1998c-7fff-d348-5f2e-971da563a2a5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Near schools, malls, upcoming metro</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c82a5ef2-7fff-f397-3d25-a4d8a93caaf7\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Wipro Park</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-cce19a87-7fff-ba75-99ca-6ae90e5fa4dd\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">35,000 – 50,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a4e2478d-7fff-a9ba-2f26-eac5f7e86520\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">50,000 – 75,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5b29ad63-7fff-6390-23c9-a97066f7fb1f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Safety &amp; Luxury</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-30557271-7fff-f41a-31c7-d9ac3ac6a99c\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Gated societies, parks, low traffic</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-20776638-7fff-2d71-e4c0-860e8329c183\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Haralur</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b8c7f626-7fff-dc10-51bc-3fef7636a691\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">25,000 – 38,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b6aa7b1d-7fff-cdc5-9cba-d60c26b69250\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">35,000 – 55,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2309f75c-7fff-7f9e-4417-53857cf8ff9a\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Budget-conscious families</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0cae2ff3-7fff-1120-8c39-74d5a8968f9f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Peaceful, green spaces</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c36cf56d-7fff-5cf8-1620-611a8f672d9e\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Bellandur</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-38d0afdf-7fff-fee3-fb9b-3fcbaa71e7db\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">32,000 – 48,000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-536e9fe4-7